    //   2.2-9 kHz @ 0.55, body floor 230 -> 280 Hz, gain 0.035 -> 0.045 (+4.8 dB at 500 Hz), and it
    //   moved FURTHER from the wind signature. CandleBedGain stays untouched, now refuted by
